# =============================================================================
# Things that must never be committed
# =============================================================================
# This repo is mostly plain text that Quickshell reads directly — there is no
# build step and therefore very little to ignore. Most of what follows is junk
# that other programs leave lying around.

# --- macOS and iCloud --------------------------------------------------------
# This folder lives inside iCloud Drive, and iCloud is untidy. `.DS_Store` is
# Finder's own bookkeeping. The "* 2" pattern catches iCloud's sync-conflict
# copies, which have bitten this project before: see the iCloud warnings in
# ../CLAUDE.md. If you ever find a file here you did not create, check whether it
# is a resurrected copy of something git already deleted BEFORE assuming it is
# somebody's work in progress.
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon?
._*
* 2
* 2.*
*\ 2

# --- Editors -----------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.qmlls.ini

# --- Qt / QML ----------------------------------------------------------------
# We ship no compiled artefacts, but Qt Creator and the QML tooling scatter
# these around if anybody opens the folder with them.
*.qmlc
*.jsc
.qmlcache/
build/
build-*/
CMakeLists.txt.user*

# --- Quickshell runtime ------------------------------------------------------
# Quickshell keeps per-configuration state and cache folders of its own. They
# belong to the machine running the shell, not to the shell.
.cache/
.state/

# --- Logs and scratch --------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.tmp
scratch/
